msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, splendid...⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫You have finally awoken."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, esplêndido...⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Você finalmente acordou."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D6CCF4FC_DAA4_44F3_A35A_928A6859D487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ebfada327852e5a76058a1b8cb8ef32c5fe94d7f5a78dff829ffab254d2a0f8
#. default-sha256: 70793642cf9a2a99d8a375cd6ae388d5c1aaef0261f28ddc0c46a070ad4e07f2
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D6CCF4FC_DAA4_44F3_A35A_928A6859D487"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have simply been waiting so long for this moment."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu simplesmente tenho esperado muito por esse momento."

#: scenario6:scenario6_EFCBAFD9_6E52_4944_8753_711F7D9B6242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1917bdf96b00e2737a0fc46846d24ed00cd29d8e01ecb3b89e24b24571efe0a
#. default-sha256: 4b7393addb62dd795840f1019c8c6e7be29a888a671ef549eb57703eb54ea14e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_EFCBAFD9_6E52_4944_8753_711F7D9B6242"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tending to the mansion all by my lonesome,⟪k:1⟫ensuring it was ready for your return, Master—"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫whenever that time may be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cuidando da mansão sozinha,⟪k:1⟫garantindo que estivesse pronta para seu retorno, Mestre—"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫fosse quando fosse."

#: scenario6:scenario6_0C8D0830_48A8_4A58_A8AC_3AE5EA6582BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12f4dd7540e8e0213c1da678de18ef0ced0fd75dfe37e63b6e03242eb2201ac0
#. default-sha256: 2d3684c18fba1b56c25ead37b9d7467db05c97495baa0f74b160738f22c97bd2
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0C8D0830_48A8_4A58_A8AC_3AE5EA6582BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I caught sight of you through the window,⟪k:1⟫my heart fluttered. ⟪k:2⟫The time had "
"finally arrived."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando te avistei pela janela,⟪k:1⟫meu coração vibrou. ⟪k:2⟫A hora tinha finalmente chegado."

#: scenario6:scenario6_67B74B9F_702E_4DDA_9756_FBF35BA48BFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22b5dbcb0f036fa7be89172f8a6aa924cb506340c0a7703f3789f19cd4a32433
#. default-sha256: b3475026eeddb922676aef2652b6053a44dac38b662742db1a33d016320e9468
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_67B74B9F_702E_4DDA_9756_FBF35BA48BFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh my, you do not know who I am?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Do you not know who you are, either?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh Deus, você não sabe quem eu sou?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Inclusive não sabe quem você é?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_2D316048_7959_4D35_9CC6_A42713AAF5F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9146d2226b87f219012cfe7377c2c9e98de62e1001b0c60a3cb52653e50fbf4
#. default-sha256: f9e1280040e93d61c1ec1a63807e7a64d164653840925e614048bd637175dce6
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2D316048_7959_4D35_9CC6_A42713AAF5F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That is quite the predicament."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Que situação."

#: scenario6:scenario6_39AFFC0F_BAC7_44C7_9951_ACB95A3C6BFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b65b4e7a00aefbdffbd6ba8d289309ff94aba5840effc47fd4435ece3dbf59d
#. default-sha256: c510d6ab6a3f47904ec36e413794c07d5901592a556edcff6ac8241babfcd0b8
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_39AFFC0F_BAC7_44C7_9951_ACB95A3C6BFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Then how about this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Então que tal isto?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_F56C1453_143C_4056_A206_C584B42B7282
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cea76e8a36f2bf365c2d991900a96bae3396d4547eedb69857b5c3ebf29af4e
#. default-sha256: 272bbdb6e49cd69f93b88fc3f2f4589159507d9488f573f718fe93f9ebabb523
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F56C1453_143C_4056_A206_C584B42B7282"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am a servant of this mansion, and as such, I am familiar with the many incidents that have "
"taken place here.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I shall show you the history of this house, Master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sou uma serva desta mansão, portanto, tenho familiaridade com os muitos incidentes que aqui "
"tomaram lugar.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu devo te mostrar a história desta casa, Mestre."

#: scenario6:scenario6_82B04417_9973_4CFA_B57C_199EC1D32C00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8f390735defc43693d404af2a33980b776a45d51d51e6f0c2b6dbc605833579
#. default-sha256: 00dc543db1037e2a99834bb16a512c3171c00cc5d20c425bf0fbb0ce27c6ac42
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_82B04417_9973_4CFA_B57C_199EC1D32C00"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Let us be off, then.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And fear not—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I merely entreat you not to let go "
"of my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vamos indo, então.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E não tema—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫eu apenas suplico que não solte minha "
"mão."

#: scenario6:scenario6_4863F686_6A3A_40FA_8698_038389769158
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eed5dfde957a2f29e054ff81228af0395f1949785d0a5688bd9e0316789e2e53
#. default-sha256: 8cb5199915cbcc3284ef1949ec74e5ba8f7873e64d2a779813c2326497031c91
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_4863F686_6A3A_40FA_8698_038389769158"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Should you hold it tightly, you need not worry about being washed away by the waves of "
"history."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se você segurar firmemente, não precisa temer ser levado pelas ondas da história."

#: scenario6:scenario6_24F59810_6B2E_4DD4_AB93_1073D746BA04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 537db886844dea687bf68138bd66e79eb1ec413c81278e46fa2f99e7c8ebd8ab
#. default-sha256: fc5051c6f2c19e44dce3956e7e5f93d35a526edb7b3727b9e7b3e6389491140d
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_24F59810_6B2E_4DD4_AB93_1073D746BA04"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No matter what happens, you mustn’t let go of my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não importa o que aconteça, não deve soltar minha mão."

#: scenario6:scenario6_163EC0D0_E2FF_4174_9059_D4A83D451B52
