msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If she were to wrap her hands around my neck, she wouldn’t even have to squeeze to stop me "
"from breathing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se ela colocasse as mãos em volta do meu pescoço, nem precisaria apertar para me impedir de "
"respirar."

